---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd."
  description="Learn about Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd., our simulated Kampala processing mill, regulatory standing under UCDA, and smallholder farmer networks across Mount Elgon and Rwenzori."
>
  <!-- Page Header with Photographic Background Image -->
  <div 
    class="relative text-white py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-stone-800 bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.78) 0%, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.90) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511537190424-bbbab87ac5eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-600/40 text-[10px] text-amber-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
          <span>PROTOTYPE SHOWCASE</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-serif tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Grounding Ugandan Coffee Heritage in Global Export Excellence
        </h1>
        <p class="text-stone-200 text-sm sm:text-base mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd. serves as a demonstration portal showcasing how Ugandan origin coffees are processed, quality-verified, and exported to international markets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Company Overview & Heritage -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-6 reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block">
            OUR PURPOSE
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Connecting Highland Smallholders Directly to Global Coffee Desks
          </h2>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Designed as a high-standard commodity export model, Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd. represents an integrated originator, dry miller, and green coffee logistics manager.
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            While Uganda has historically been recognized as Africa leading exporter of Robusta, this showcase illustrates how dedicated specialty divisions establish washing stations in Mount Elgon and the Rwenzori foothills to deliver high-scoring Arabica lots alongside fine Robusta.
          </p>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">
            <div>
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif text-coffee-700">100%</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-stone-800 mt-1">Ugandan Origin Model</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Headquartered in Kampala Industrial Area</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif text-coffee-700">UCDA</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-stone-800 mt-1">Simulated Certification</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Demonstrating regulatory audit compliance</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar Box -->
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-stone-200 space-y-8 reveal-on-scroll delay-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
            Our Operational Pillars
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm">
                01
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase tracking-wide">Milling Integrity</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                  We maintain strict separation between Arabica and Robusta processing streams at our Kampala mill, preventing flavor cross-contamination.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm">
                02
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase tracking-wide">Fair Smallholder Remuneration</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                  Farmer partners receive immediate cash settlements at farm-gate collection centers, plus quality bonus premiums upon cupping verification.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm">
                03
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase tracking-wide">Supply Chain Predictability</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                  From Kampala rail head to the Port of Mombasa, bonded logistics partners adhere to strict delivery timetables and container seal protocols.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Processing Mill & Logistics Center with Background Image -->
  <section 
    class="py-24 text-white relative bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.94) 0%, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.84) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447933601403-0c6688de566e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-300 block mb-2">
          CENTRAL FACILITY
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-white tracking-tight">
          Plot 45, Industrial Area, Kampala
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Situated at the heart of Kampala export corridor, our industrial complex model integrates high-capacity dry milling, pneumatic grading, optical sorting, and climate-controlled parchment storage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-stone-900/80 backdrop-blur-md p-7 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">Section A</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-serif">Secondary Hulling & Destoning</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
            High-efficiency pre-cleaners, magnetic separators, and impact hullers gently remove dry husk and parchment without fracturing green seed embryos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-stone-900/80 backdrop-blur-md p-7 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">Section B</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-serif">Screen Sizing & Optical Sorting</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
            Vibratory screen decks sort beans according to standard screen gauges (Screen 18, 17, 15, and PB), followed by optical color sorters that inspect thousands of beans per second.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-stone-900/80 backdrop-blur-md p-7 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">Section C</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-serif">Bonded Stuffing Bays</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
            Weather-sealed loading bays permit 20ft maritime containers to be backed directly into the mill, protecting bagged green coffee from tropical humidity during loading.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Governance & Accreditations -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-stone-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block mb-1">
          REGULATORY ACCREDITATION
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight">
          Simulated National and Global Compliance
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-base text-stone-900">UCDA Alignment</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">Simulating export licensing and inspection procedures under the Uganda Coffee Development Authority.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-base text-stone-900">EUDR Geolocation</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">Complete farm polygon data sets formatted for European Union Deforestation Regulation submission.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-base text-stone-900">Q-Grader Protocols</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">In-house sensory lab model operated according to Specialty Coffee Association standards.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-base text-stone-900">Phytosanitary Process</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">Official inspection certificates coordinated under Ministry of Agriculture guidelines.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Bar with Background Image -->
  <section 
    class="py-16 text-white relative bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.85), rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.85)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514432324607-a09d9b4aefdd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 relative z-10">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white">Explore Demo Exporter Platform</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 mt-1">Connect with our demo trade desk for simulated harvest offers and contract schedules.</p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/quote"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-[#A35326] hover:bg-[#8E431B] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-md"
      >
        Request Demo Quote
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
